org.cef.* — Embedded from CCBlueX's java-cef fork (modern MCEF kernel).
Source: https://github.com/CCBlueX/java-cef (branch: 26.2)
Commit: b853a9d87fd0a7553001ce0785fee73d55be8d64
Upstream: https://github.com/jcef-build/java-cef / CEF Java bindings (BSD, see LICENSE.txt in this directory).

Modifications relative to upstream (marked with "MCEF-PORT:" comments):
  - org/cef/browser/CefBrowserOsr.java: added the legacy net.montoyo.mcef
    compatibility surface (protected CefRenderer renderer_, frame queue,
    mcefUpdate(), legacy inject* entry points, draw/getTextureID/resize)
    so that the montoyo-style client (mcphone-addon-browser) can drive the
    browser without LWJGL/AWT dependencies.
Natives (libcef.so / libjcef.so / jcef_helper) are NOT bundled; they are
downloaded at runtime from the MCEF mirror infrastructure and loaded with
System.load(absolute path).
